Package: freedoom
Name: Freedoom
Version: @DEB_FREEDOOM_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Author: Contributors to the Freedoom project
Section: Games
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://freedoom.github.io/
Description: Free game data for Doom source ports
 Freedoom: Phase 1 (freedoom1.wad) and Freedoom: Phase 2 (freedoom2.wad), the
 complete free replacement IWADs for Doom and Doom II. They install into
 /var/jb/usr/share/games/doom, where crispy-doom looks for game data, so the
 game starts with no other files.
 .
 Freedoom is under the BSD license; see
 /var/jb/usr/share/doc/freedoom/COPYING.
